cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenDHFS in research, forensic methodology, or published work, please cite the software using the metadata below."

title: "OpenDHFS: Forensic Recovery Toolkit"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Hernández"
    given-names: "Gabriel"

abstract: >-
  OpenDHFS is an open-source forensic recovery toolkit for physical
  analysis of DVR/NVR storage, DHFS/DHAV structures, HEVC reconstruction,
  recovery-anchor expansion, residual recovery, decoder validation,
  and recovery-surface exhaustion auditing.

repository-code: "https://github.com/OpenDHFS/OpenDHFS"

license: "Apache-2.0"

keywords:
  - digital forensics
  - video forensics
  - DVR
  - NVR
  - CCTV
  - DHFS
  - DHAV
  - HEVC
  - H.265
  - data recovery
  - forensic recovery

date-released: "2026-08-17"
